cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or derived data, please cite both the article and this repository."
title: "Directional Centroid Trajectories of Fire Activity Across Brazilian Biomes — analysis code and derived data"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline and derived datasets reproducing the figures and quantitative
  results of Ramos-Neto & Hofmann (2026), which characterizes the spatial
  reorganization of fire activity across Brazilian biomes (1985-2024) using
  directional centroid trajectories from MapBiomas Fire Collection 4.
type: software
authors:
